  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img height=\"127\" src=\"assets\\st0037_fdb0c12fc5c1.png\" width=\"207\" /></p><p>Writing the torque about the instantaneous axis of rotation we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#964;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Also,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>a</mi></math></p><p>Substituting the values and solving for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p>"
  }
